"Kucing Merah": Meow.
Sira: (This is... a newcomer. Jitendra likes to call her kucing merah or Kume.)
if {feeding_animals} == true and {kucingmerah_fed} == false:
	Sira: (Kume came in waltzing into the village one day and stole our fishes.)
	Sira: (We've never really seen a species like her.)
	Sira: (She very fiesty, but comes around skittishly for food anyway.)
	Sira: (I hope more of Kume's family visits us so me and Jitendra can learn about them.)
	Sira: (Maybe now I can pet her...)
	audio "res://asset/sound/cat_hiss.mp3"
	"Kucing Merah": *HIIISSSSS*!
	Sira: (Nevermind.)
	- Feed Kume.
		set {kucingmerah_fed} = true
		[signal arg="animal_fed"]
		audio "res://asset/sound/crunch.mp3"
		*Kume chomps on the fish then bolts away*
	- Later.
		Sira: I'll feed her later.